    "body": "### Environment\n\nSecond Life version 26.2.0.25021396775\n\n### Description\n\nViewer copyright dates need to be updated.\n\n### Reproduction steps\n\n1. On a mac,\n2. Right-click the application icon and click Get Info\n3. Check the Copyright information\n\nObserved: The copyright says \"Copyright \u00a9 Linden Research, Inc. 2020\"\n\n1. On windows,\n2. Right-click the SL application and click Properties, then the Details tab\n3. Check the Copyright information\n\nObserved: The copyright says \"Copyright (c) 2020, Linden Research, Inc.\"\n\nExpected: Copyright should be up to date.\n<br/>\n<hr/>\n\n<details><summary>This repo is using Opire - what does it mean? \ud83d\udc47</summary><br/>\ud83d\udcb5 Everyone can add rewards for this issue commenting <code>/reward 100</code> (replace <code>100</code> with the amount).<br/>\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f If someone starts working on this issue to earn the rewards, they can comment <code>/try</code> to let everyone know!<br/>\ud83d\ude4c And when they open the PR, they can comment <code>/claim #5775</code> either in the PR description or in a PR's comment.<br/><br/>\ud83e\ude99 Also, everyone can tip any user commenting <code>/tip 20 @Dan-Linden</code> (replace <code>20</code> with the amount, and <code>@Dan-Linden</code> with the user to tip).<br/><br/>\ud83d\udcd6 If you want to learn more, check out our <a href=\"https://docs.opire.dev\">documentation</a>.</details>",
